# Full-size 3000px originals: ~182MB, and the site never serves them. The
# generated portraits/thumbs/ and portraits/display/ copies are committed
# instead. These patterns only match files directly in portraits/, so the two
# subfolders are unaffected.
/portraits/*.jpg
/portraits/*.jpeg
/portraits/*.png

